# Diamond story 26-pastoria-gym-wake-fen-badge: standalone start (--lab, or no end save from 25-route214-valor-route213-to-pastoria).
# Standard header + lab party + the cumulative state after 25-route214-valor-route213-to-pastoria, then the milestone's start.
# Applied on the D/P new-game base save (bedroom), so INIT_NEW_GAME state (scr_seq 0377) is present; RemoveEvent sets
# an object's hidden_flag (games/diamond/arm9/src/map_object.c:295-299). The starter var comes from the prior deltas.
name GQ
gender PLAYER_GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 31415
money 20000
# Lab party (slice convention): Surf in slot 0, slots 1-3 cleared so an empty Surf falls back to Struggle.
# Opponents: TRAINER_LEADER_WAKE_WAKE (trdata.json #316: GYARADOS 27, QUAGSIRE 27, FLOATZEL 30) and the gym trainers
# #497 BUIZEL 26, #339 WINGULL 24 x2, #498 AZURILL 24 + MARILL 24, #483 SHELLOS 24/WINGULL 24/SHELLOS 24,
# #293 GOLDEEN 22/BARBOACH 23/GYARADOS 24, #401 BARBOACH 26: Surf from a level-60 Empoleon wins even where resisted.
party SPECIES_EMPOLEON 60 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_SURF
party-move 0 1 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 2 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 3 MOVE_NONE
party SPECIES_STARAPTOR 50 ITEM_NONE
party-move 1 0 MOVE_AERIAL_ACE
party-move 1 1 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
party-move 1 2 MOVE_CUT
# @@PRIOR@@
# -- start --
warp MAP_PASTORIA_GYM 0  # (13,42), zone_event 0121 warp 0 (MAP_PASTORIA warp 0 (589,827) leads here)
